      "side": 1,
      "message": "It has the same issue - `use_highbitdepth` gets changed but the function pointers are not updated.\n\nIn libvpx, setting function pointers to lowbd ones is in `vp9_create_compressor` and then overwritten if highbd is set. There\u0027s no other way around at the moment...",
